Exits and which networks use them

Usage:
  olr routing [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add an exit
  disable     Remove routing policy, leaving the box routing normally
  enable      Apply routing policy
  rm          Remove an exit, or a network's assignment
  set         Choose which exit a network uses
  show        Show exits and which networks use them
  status      Show each exit's health, what uses it, and drift

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for routing

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr routing [command] --help" for more information about a command.
